acceptance_criteria: "F10: preserve host conflict identity, exit 4 and recovery through graph commands; package usage errors satisfy the SDK expected-error predicate, with a failing behavioural revert proof.; F11: declare all four positive integer blocker-cut budgets in workspace contracts, consume normalized options, preserve receipts and no-git operation, and prove registration/parser reversion fails."
resolution: "Graph commands retain native conflict identity, exit/recovery metadata and SDK expected errors; four positive blocker budgets are declared/normalized with revert-failing no-git regressions."
expected_result: "F10: preserve host conflict identity, exit 4 and recovery through graph commands; package usage errors satisfy the SDK expected-error predicate, with a failing behavioural revert proof.; F11: declare all four positive integer blocker-cut budgets in workspace contracts, consume normalized options, preserve receipts and no-git operation, and prove registration/parser reversion fails."
